    "display": "Original mask palette matched to independent rendered black/white output. Magenta highlights thresholded binary output changes; blue in the source marks unobserved pixels. No inference from antialias-only changes.",
    "observations": [
      "All nineteen changed native outputs inspected beside fixed source masks and prior release outputs. Changes are localized boundary shifts; no new loss of a large motif was apparent at the inspected resolution.",
      "The bird eye and the small enclosed puppy opening survive. Extra frame bends, contacts and short visible seams remain; this review does not certify original design recovery or physical assembly.",
      "The outlined star still omits a small bottom-edge source fragment. It remains a feature-fidelity failure despite less than one percent total disagreement.",
      "The bauble retains a legal four-plus-four routing but about 4.40% observed disagreement and substantial source/crop defects. It remains a quality failure.",
      "Dense/floral checker outputs remain rounded and uneven. The largest observed-error increase is on the floral checker; no universal quality gain is claimed.",
      "Nineteen results differ in timed refinement. Only three cases record the new initial-geometry preference; other differences cannot be attributed to it from this single run."
